  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "第一次来啊，也没准备什么，这个你拿着不多，两千块，你别嫌少，两千怎么了？你觉得不重要，本来就是个心意，那这新衣我不要了，你什么意思啊？今天真去周凯家，嗯，他爸妈说想见见我，第一次见家长，别光听他们嘴上怎么说，那看什么看他爸妈舍不舍得，头一次见儿媳妇，最能看出一个家庭对你的态度。我到楼下了，来的路上，你告诉我，你爸妈特别重视这次见面，可现在你又告诉我多少钱不重要，姑娘两千块还少吗？两千不少。可我要看的不是两千块，是你们到底有多重视我。所以你现在要因为两千块钱走你到现在都没听懂。我的意思是啊，这姑娘还没缓过来分了，真，因为那两千，他说不是钱，是态度。那我给你介绍一个，没兴趣就一起吃顿饭。行，不好意思，我没迟到吧。嗯，没有两个人，三个菜够了吧，再来一份澳洲牛排。你不是已经点牛排了吗？那个是你的怎么了？是没事儿，我问个比较现实的问题，你问你对男方经济条件有什么要求，工作稳定，别欠一屁股债房呢，有最好没有就一起挣车呢，能开就行。是不是觉得我要求太低了，有点儿我要求可不低。比如脾气不能太差，不能赌博，有事、别躲，还有最重要的一条。什么结婚以后自己的事儿自己做主，不能什么事儿都听爸妈的。嗯，阿姨给你留饭了。嗯，那你少吃点儿，为什么回去继续喝啊？你的车嗯挺好的，不嫌旧车不就是代步的吗？不过你这个右前轮气好像有点不足，赶紧补补，不然跑高速不是很安全。你们公司经理都换奔驰了，你怎么还开这个还能开能开跟拿不拿得出手是两回事儿，不是说不用买吗？第一次见叔叔阿姨，空手不好，多少钱一百多，怎么嫌便宜？不是进去吧。第一次来，阿姨也没准备什么一点心意，你拿着阿姨真不用拿着吧，也不多两千，谢谢阿姨，你不嫌少嫌少，见面里还有嫌少的吗？您愿意给我，就说明您欢迎我，这不就是心意吗？对了，阿姨，我也不知道你喜欢什么，就买了，点水果来就来了，还买什么东西第一次见面嘛，心意必须要到，还是那个红包，还是两千块。可这一次，我终于能笑着坐下来好好吃顿饭，也不知道你爱吃什么，阿姨就随便做了几个菜，阿姨这还叫随便做啊，这么一大桌子。我刚进门就闻到香味了，你尝尝这个个，不过阿姨不太会做饭，做的肯定没有你妈妈做的好吃。阿姨这还真没法比，我妈做的是我从小吃大的家的味道。您今天这一桌是知道我要来特意准备的心意，一个是家的味道，一个是您的心意，这哪能放在一起比呢？你这姑娘还挺会说话，不过阿姨您可别再给我夹菜了，怎么不好吃，哪能啊？我是怕第一次来就吃三碗饭，下次您听说我来还得提前多买两斤米，哈哈哈，能吃是福，多吃点儿。姑娘阿姨，问你个问题，你别介意啊。您问以后，你跟陈默要是真结婚了，你们家谁说了算？没问你我问人家姑娘呢？阿姨，我觉得谁说了都不算，那谁说了算，谁说的有道理，谁说了算？两个人过日子，又不是争领导小事，互相让一步大事做下来，一起商量，非得分出谁听谁的那日子不就过成上下级了吗？这话说的倒挺在理。妈，你今天这是吃饭还是面试啊？你闭嘴，人家姑娘比你会说多了。那阿姨再问你最后一个，您说以后你们两个真结婚了，要是有一天我跟你闹矛盾了，你希望她帮谁妈，你怎么什么都问啊，你别说话，阿姨这个问题我可不能让他选，为什么您是生他养他的妈妈？我要是真跟他结婚了，就是陪他过日子的人一个是亲情，一个是爱情，本来就没有谁输谁赢，真有矛盾的时候，谁有道理就听谁的。要是我们两个非逼着他选一个，那最后为难的不还是沉默吗？你看看人家姑娘，怎么每次最后还说的都是我，谁让人家比你懂事。阿姨，我帮您收拾吧。不用，你第一次来是客人，哪有让客人洗碗的道理。那好，今天我听您的，等以后来的次数多了，您不把我当客人了，到时候可不能再拦着我。你这姑娘第一次来就想着以后了，您饭也让我吃了，红包也让我收了，我总不能吃完就不认账吧。哈哈哈哈哈哈。好，以后有时间常来，我现在是真服你了，怎么了？我妈给你两千块，你一句话就把她说高兴了。吃饭的时候，她说做饭没，你妈妈好吃，换成我，我都不知道怎么接。后面又问你结婚以后谁说了算，还问她跟你闹矛盾了，我应该帮谁一坐，旁边听着都替你紧张，你到底是怎么练的？为什么别人突然给你一句话，你马上就知道该怎么接？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，也不知道怎么组织语言，一到这种场合就不知道应该说说什么。后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下无弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的看一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同场景之下应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我支付道路上最大的功臣，同时向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说，我可你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费，这个有意思。我第一次读到这些的时候，也有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接接了。这本先借我看看，拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 1350,
      "text": "第一次来啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1370,
      "end_ms": 2410,
      "text": "也没准备什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2590,
      "end_ms": 4250,
      "text": "这个你拿着不多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4550,
      "end_ms": 5210,
      "text": "两千块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5490,
      "end_ms": 6210,
      "text": "你别嫌少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7610,
      "end_ms": 10915,
      "text": "两千怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14040,
      "end_ms": 14880,
      "text": "你觉得不重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15040,
      "end_ms": 16065,
      "text": "本来就是个心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18710,
      "end_ms": 19870,
      "text": "那这新衣我不要了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20410,
      "end_ms": 21435,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 25670,
      "text": "今天真去周凯家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27110,
      "end_ms": 27350,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28050,
      "end_ms": 29510,
      "text": "他爸妈说想见见我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29990,
      "end_ms": 31050,
      "text": "第一次见家长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31410,
      "end_ms": 32750,
      "text": "别光听他们嘴上怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33390,
      "end_ms": 35470,
      "text": "那看什么看他爸妈舍不舍得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35830,
      "end_ms": 37030,
      "text": "头一次见儿媳妇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37150,
      "end_ms": 38930,
      "text": "最能看出一个家庭对你的态度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40250,
      "end_ms": 41205,
      "text": "我到楼下了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43340,
      "end_ms": 43880,
      "text": "来的路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43880,
      "end_ms": 44600,
      "text": "你告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 44620,
      "end_ms": 46340,
      "text": "你爸妈特别重视这次见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46740,
      "end_ms": 48600,
      "text": "可现在你又告诉我多少钱不重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 48920,
      "end_ms": 51460,
      "text": "姑娘两千块还少吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 52660,
      "end_ms": 53560,
      "text": "两千不少。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 55960,
      "text": "可我要看的不是两千块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 56600,
      "end_ms": 58160,
      "text": "是你们到底有多重视我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58480,
      "end_ms": 64980,
      "text": "所以你现在要因为两千块钱走你到现在都没听懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 64980,
      "end_ms": 71345,
      "text": "我的意思是啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 72490,
      "end_ms": 78825,
      "text": "这姑娘还没缓过来分了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79910,
      "end_ms": 80070,
      "text": "真，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 80070,
      "end_ms": 80815,
      "text": "因为那两千，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81360,
      "end_ms": 82000,
      "text": "他说不是钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82000,
      "end_ms": 82635,
      "text": "是态度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 83420,
      "end_ms": 84305,
      "text": "那我给你介绍一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 84630,
      "end_ms": 87265,
      "text": "没兴趣就一起吃顿饭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 89480,
      "end_ms": 89795,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93770,
      "end_ms": 94290,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94290,
      "end_ms": 95115,
      "text": "我没迟到吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95670,
      "end_ms": 95945,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96250,
      "end_ms": 100540,
      "text": "没有两个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 100560,
      "end_ms": 101545,
      "text": "三个菜够了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 104100,
      "end_ms": 105305,
      "text": "再来一份澳洲牛排。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105800,
      "end_ms": 107205,
      "text": "你不是已经点牛排了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 107550,
      "end_ms": 111015,
      "text": "那个是你的怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 112960,
      "end_ms": 114335,
      "text": "是没事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 117110,
      "end_ms": 118345,
      "text": "我问个比较现实的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 119210,
      "end_ms": 122390,
      "text": "你问你对男方经济条件有什么要求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 123370,
      "end_ms": 124270,
      "text": "工作稳定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 124630,
      "end_ms": 126790,
      "text": "别欠一屁股债房呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127870,
      "end_ms": 130910,
      "text": "有最好没有就一起挣车呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 131710,
      "end_ms": 132470,
      "text": "能开就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 133430,
      "end_ms": 135210,
      "text": "是不是觉得我要求太低了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 135990,
      "end_ms": 137850,
      "text": "有点儿我要求可不低。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 138290,
      "end_ms": 140010,
      "text": "比如脾气不能太差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 140250,
      "end_ms": 140970,
      "text": "不能赌博，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141210,
      "end_ms": 141930,
      "text": "有事、别躲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 142970,
      "end_ms": 144110,
      "text": "还有最重要的一条。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144210,
      "end_ms": 147310,
      "text": "什么结婚以后自己的事儿自己做主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147610,
      "end_ms": 149825,
      "text": "不能什么事儿都听爸妈的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152150,
      "end_ms": 152390,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 156290,
      "end_ms": 157430,
      "text": "阿姨给你留饭了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 158510,
      "end_ms": 158955,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 161340,
      "end_ms": 162500,
      "text": "那你少吃点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 163620,
      "end_ms": 166480,
      "text": "为什么回去继续喝啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 168160,
      "end_ms": 171315,
      "text": "你的车嗯挺好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 173120,
      "end_ms": 175720,
      "text": "不嫌旧车不就是代步的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 176480,
      "end_ms": 179260,
      "text": "不过你这个右前轮气好像有点不足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 179260,
      "end_ms": 180000,
      "text": "赶紧补补，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 180060,
      "end_ms": 181625,
      "text": "不然跑高速不是很安全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182320,
      "end_ms": 184100,
      "text": "你们公司经理都换奔驰了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 184100,
      "end_ms": 189355,
      "text": "你怎么还开这个还能开能开跟拿不拿得出手是两回事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 195450,
      "end_ms": 196625,
      "text": "不是说不用买吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 197030,
      "end_ms": 198230,
      "text": "第一次见叔叔阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 198410,
      "end_ms": 199225,
      "text": "空手不好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 200440,
      "end_ms": 202025,
      "text": "多少钱一百多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 202520,
      "end_ms": 203745,
      "text": "怎么嫌便宜？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 204070,
      "end_ms": 206795,
      "text": "不是进去吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 208190,
      "end_ms": 209055,
      "text": "第一次来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 209780,
      "end_ms": 211980,
      "text": "阿姨也没准备什么一点心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 211980,
      "end_ms": 215550,
      "text": "你拿着阿姨真不用拿着吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 215550,
      "end_ms": 216675,
      "text": "也不多两千，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 219780,
      "end_ms": 220595,
      "text": "谢谢阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 220880,
      "end_ms": 222765,
      "text": "你不嫌少嫌少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 223280,
      "end_ms": 224785,
      "text": "见面里还有嫌少的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 225260,
      "end_ms": 226200,
      "text": "您愿意给我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 226400,
      "end_ms": 227985,
      "text": "就说明您欢迎我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 228440,
      "end_ms": 229475,
      "text": "这不就是心意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 232900,
      "end_ms": 233180,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 233180,
      "end_ms": 233575,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 233920,
      "end_ms": 235360,
      "text": "我也不知道你喜欢什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 235540,
      "end_ms": 235940,
      "text": "就买了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 235940,
      "end_ms": 237950,
      "text": "点水果来就来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 238130,
      "end_ms": 241260,
      "text": "还买什么东西第一次见面嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 241540,
      "end_ms": 242685,
      "text": "心意必须要到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 246040,
      "end_ms": 247000,
      "text": "还是那个红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 247400,
      "end_ms": 248240,
      "text": "还是两千块。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 248960,
      "end_ms": 249680,
      "text": "可这一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 250200,
      "end_ms": 253295,
      "text": "我终于能笑着坐下来好好吃顿饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 257000,
      "end_ms": 258520,
      "text": "也不知道你爱吃什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 258820,
      "end_ms": 260380,
      "text": "阿姨就随便做了几个菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 260720,
      "end_ms": 262780,
      "text": "阿姨这还叫随便做啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 262880,
      "end_ms": 263920,
      "text": "这么一大桌子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 264000,
      "end_ms": 265640,
      "text": "我刚进门就闻到香味了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 265920,
      "end_ms": 267620,
      "text": "你尝尝这个个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 267620,
      "end_ms": 269340,
      "text": "不过阿姨不太会做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 269340,
      "end_ms": 271800,
      "text": "做的肯定没有你妈妈做的好吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 271800,
      "end_ms": 274260,
      "text": "阿姨这还真没法比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 274260,
      "end_ms": 276780,
      "text": "我妈做的是我从小吃大的家的味道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 277200,
      "end_ms": 280360,
      "text": "您今天这一桌是知道我要来特意准备的心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 280780,
      "end_ms": 282040,
      "text": "一个是家的味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 282140,
      "end_ms": 283300,
      "text": "一个是您的心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 283640,
      "end_ms": 285875,
      "text": "这哪能放在一起比呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287030,
      "end_ms": 288830,
      "text": "你这姑娘还挺会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 289110,
      "end_ms": 291450,
      "text": "不过阿姨您可别再给我夹菜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 291610,
      "end_ms": 293130,
      "text": "怎么不好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 293890,
      "end_ms": 294630,
      "text": "哪能啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 294810,
      "end_ms": 296710,
      "text": "我是怕第一次来就吃三碗饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 297130,
      "end_ms": 299805,
      "text": "下次您听说我来还得提前多买两斤米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 300420,
      "end_ms": 300910,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 302110,
      "end_ms": 303090,
      "text": "能吃是福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 303410,
      "end_ms": 304035,
      "text": "多吃点儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 306400,
      "end_ms": 307860,
      "text": "姑娘阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 307860,
      "end_ms": 308600,
      "text": "问你个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 308660,
      "end_ms": 309560,
      "text": "你别介意啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 310120,
      "end_ms": 311780,
      "text": "您问以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 311780,
      "end_ms": 313580,
      "text": "你跟陈默要是真结婚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 313760,
      "end_ms": 314880,
      "text": "你们家谁说了算？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 316720,
      "end_ms": 318780,
      "text": "没问你我问人家姑娘呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 319060,
      "end_ms": 319500,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 319740,
      "end_ms": 321060,
      "text": "我觉得谁说了都不算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 321340,
      "end_ms": 322260,
      "text": "那谁说了算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 322560,
      "end_ms": 323580,
      "text": "谁说的有道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 323580,
      "end_ms": 324280,
      "text": "谁说了算？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 324640,
      "end_ms": 325560,
      "text": "两个人过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 325560,
      "end_ms": 327520,
      "text": "又不是争领导小事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 327540,
      "end_ms": 329320,
      "text": "互相让一步大事做下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 329320,
      "end_ms": 330080,
      "text": "一起商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 330440,
      "end_ms": 334040,
      "text": "非得分出谁听谁的那日子不就过成上下级了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 335100,
      "end_ms": 336950,
      "text": "这话说的倒挺在理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 337650,
      "end_ms": 337890,
      "text": "妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 338090,
      "end_ms": 340110,
      "text": "你今天这是吃饭还是面试啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 340410,
      "end_ms": 341010,
      "text": "你闭嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 341710,
      "end_ms": 343630,
      "text": "人家姑娘比你会说多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 344570,
      "end_ms": 346130,
      "text": "那阿姨再问你最后一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 347030,
      "end_ms": 350150,
      "text": "您说以后你们两个真结婚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 350450,
      "end_ms": 352230,
      "text": "要是有一天我跟你闹矛盾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 352230,
      "end_ms": 356650,
      "text": "你希望她帮谁妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 356730,
      "end_ms": 358090,
      "text": "你怎么什么都问啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 358330,
      "end_ms": 359050,
      "text": "你别说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 360130,
      "end_ms": 362430,
      "text": "阿姨这个问题我可不能让他选，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 362910,
      "end_ms": 365925,
      "text": "为什么您是生他养他的妈妈？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 366250,
      "end_ms": 367710,
      "text": "我要是真跟他结婚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 368030,
      "end_ms": 370960,
      "text": "就是陪他过日子的人一个是亲情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 371020,
      "end_ms": 371875,
      "text": "一个是爱情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 372370,
      "end_ms": 374090,
      "text": "本来就没有谁输谁赢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 374350,
      "end_ms": 375510,
      "text": "真有矛盾的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 375570,
      "end_ms": 376925,
      "text": "谁有道理就听谁的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 377360,
      "end_ms": 379260,
      "text": "要是我们两个非逼着他选一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 379320,
      "end_ms": 381075,
      "text": "那最后为难的不还是沉默吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 382480,
      "end_ms": 383775,
      "text": "你看看人家姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 384190,
      "end_ms": 385995,
      "text": "怎么每次最后还说的都是我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 386290,
      "end_ms": 387475,
      "text": "谁让人家比你懂事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 392150,
      "end_ms": 392510,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 392570,
      "end_ms": 393390,
      "text": "我帮您收拾吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 393390,
      "end_ms": 393730,
      "text": "不用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 393830,
      "end_ms": 395170,
      "text": "你第一次来是客人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00168",
      "start_ms": 395330,
      "end_ms": 396825,
      "text": "哪有让客人洗碗的道理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00169",
      "start_ms": 397950,
      "end_ms": 398370,
      "text": "那好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00170",
      "start_ms": 398710,
      "end_ms": 399865,
      "text": "今天我听您的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00171",
      "start_ms": 400250,
      "end_ms": 402050,
      "text": "等以后来的次数多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00172",
      "start_ms": 402070,
      "end_ms": 403410,
      "text": "您不把我当客人了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00173",
      "start_ms": 403430,
      "end_ms": 405035,
      "text": "到时候可不能再拦着我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00174",
      "start_ms": 406550,
      "end_ms": 409165,
      "text": "你这姑娘第一次来就想着以后了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00175",
      "start_ms": 409890,
      "end_ms": 411210,
      "text": "您饭也让我吃了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00176",
      "start_ms": 411210,
      "end_ms": 412310,
      "text": "红包也让我收了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00177",
      "start_ms": 412350,
      "end_ms": 414055,
      "text": "我总不能吃完就不认账吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00178",
      "start_ms": 414660,
      "end_ms": 416185,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00179",
      "start_ms": 417160,
      "end_ms": 417565,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00180",
      "start_ms": 418060,
      "end_ms": 419335,
      "text": "以后有时间常来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00181",
      "start_ms": 421550,
      "end_ms": 422785,
      "text": "我现在是真服你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00182",
      "start_ms": 423290,
      "end_ms": 423805,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00183",
      "start_ms": 424130,
      "end_ms": 425170,
      "text": "我妈给你两千块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00184",
      "start_ms": 425330,
      "end_ms": 426850,
      "text": "你一句话就把她说高兴了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00185",
      "start_ms": 427290,
      "end_ms": 428050,
      "text": "吃饭的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00186",
      "start_ms": 428050,
      "end_ms": 428710,
      "text": "她说做饭没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00187",
      "start_ms": 428710,
      "end_ms": 429430,
      "text": "你妈妈好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00188",
      "start_ms": 429570,
      "end_ms": 430030,
      "text": "换成我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00189",
      "start_ms": 430030,
      "end_ms": 430950,
      "text": "我都不知道怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00190",
      "start_ms": 431210,
      "end_ms": 433130,
      "text": "后面又问你结婚以后谁说了算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00191",
      "start_ms": 433430,
      "end_ms": 434630,
      "text": "还问她跟你闹矛盾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00192",
      "start_ms": 434630,
      "end_ms": 437610,
      "text": "我应该帮谁一坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00193",
      "start_ms": 437610,
      "end_ms": 438930,
      "text": "旁边听着都替你紧张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00194",
      "start_ms": 440850,
      "end_ms": 442050,
      "text": "你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00195",
      "start_ms": 442690,
      "end_ms": 444490,
      "text": "为什么别人突然给你一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00196",
      "start_ms": 444490,
      "end_ms": 445850,
      "text": "你马上就知道该怎么接？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00197",
      "start_ms": 446610,
      "end_ms": 447910,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00198",
      "start_ms": 448450,
      "end_ms": 449230,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00199",
      "start_ms": 449950,
      "end_ms": 451170,
      "text": "也不知道怎么组织语言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00200",
      "start_ms": 451170,
      "end_ms": 454600,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00201",
      "start_ms": 455860,
      "end_ms": 458960,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00202",
      "start_ms": 459380,
      "end_ms": 460900,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00203",
      "start_ms": 460900,
      "end_ms": 462080,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00204",
      "start_ms": 462300,
      "end_ms": 465080,
      "text": "遇遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00205",
      "start_ms": 465440,
      "end_ms": 467300,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00206",
      "start_ms": 467840,
      "end_ms": 468460,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00207",
      "start_ms": 469140,
      "end_ms": 470380,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00208",
      "start_ms": 470380,
      "end_ms": 471740,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00209",
      "start_ms": 471740,
      "end_ms": 473420,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00210",
      "start_ms": 473420,
      "end_ms": 474980,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00211",
      "start_ms": 474980,
      "end_ms": 476000,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00212",
      "start_ms": 476000,
      "end_ms": 478500,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00213",
      "start_ms": 478500,
      "end_ms": 479160,
      "text": "辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00214",
      "start_ms": 479160,
      "end_ms": 480540,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00215",
      "start_ms": 480540,
      "end_ms": 481740,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00216",
      "start_ms": 481740,
      "end_ms": 483160,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00217",
      "start_ms": 483160,
      "end_ms": 485090,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00218",
      "start_ms": 485390,
      "end_ms": 487090,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00219",
      "start_ms": 487770,
      "end_ms": 489230,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00220",
      "start_ms": 489530,
      "end_ms": 490970,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00221",
      "start_ms": 490970,
      "end_ms": 492610,
      "text": "一个场景的看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00222",
      "start_ms": 492610,
      "end_ms": 493450,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00223",
      "start_ms": 494270,
      "end_ms": 495350,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00224",
      "start_ms": 495750,
      "end_ms": 498850,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00225",
      "start_ms": 499290,
      "end_ms": 501210,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00226",
      "start_ms": 501430,
      "end_ms": 502770,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00227",
      "start_ms": 502770,
      "end_ms": 505710,
      "text": "你可以回你是我支付道路上最大的功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00228",
      "start_ms": 506250,
      "end_ms": 507270,
      "text": "同时向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00229",
      "start_ms": 507290,
      "end_ms": 508050,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00230",
      "start_ms": 508190,
      "end_ms": 508710,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00231",
      "start_ms": 509010,
      "end_ms": 510330,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00232",
      "start_ms": 510350,
      "end_ms": 510950,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00233",
      "start_ms": 510950,
      "end_ms": 511590,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00234",
      "start_ms": 511690,
      "end_ms": 512870,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00235",
      "start_ms": 512870,
      "end_ms": 513865,
      "text": "我可你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00236",
      "start_ms": 514080,
      "end_ms": 515740,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00237",
      "start_ms": 515980,
      "end_ms": 517120,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00238",
      "start_ms": 517360,
      "end_ms": 518200,
      "text": "目前不收费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00239",
      "start_ms": 519640,
      "end_ms": 520480,
      "text": "这个有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00240",
      "start_ms": 520800,
      "end_ms": 522340,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00241",
      "start_ms": 522340,
      "end_ms": 523760,
      "text": "也有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00242",
      "start_ms": 524060,
      "end_ms": 527900,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00243",
      "start_ms": 528060,
      "end_ms": 529460,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00244",
      "start_ms": 529740,
      "end_ms": 530560,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00245",
      "start_ms": 530760,
      "end_ms": 531540,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00246",
      "start_ms": 531860,
      "end_ms": 533220,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00247",
      "start_ms": 533760,
      "end_ms": 535860,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00248",
      "start_ms": 536240,
      "end_ms": 538000,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00249",
      "start_ms": 538060,
      "end_ms": 541300,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00250",
      "start_ms": 541360,
      "end_ms": 543100,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00251",
      "start_ms": 543100,
      "end_ms": 544490,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00252",
      "start_ms": 544910,
      "end_ms": 546090,
      "text": "这本先借我看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00253",
      "start_ms": 546430,
      "end_ms": 546990,
      "text": "拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_37f6c3c5c4c27fd4_s00254",
      "start_ms": 546990,
      "end_ms": 547815,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
